    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>焦虑焦虑好焦虑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>20多岁的日子，总是充满了不确定性和相伴相生的焦虑情绪😭</span></p><span></span><p><span>都在说不要焦虑，到底怎么样才能不焦虑？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也感到焦虑，</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>请加入「随便你」聊天室</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>快来听三分钟「随便你」，不管怎么做都支持你！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="154">02:34</a>对所有事情都太认真的学生思维</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a>因为不想走弯路，所以焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a>我不想浪费时间啊！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="306">05:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="477">07:57</a>xx诚可贵，即使自由价更高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a>大人们不焦虑吗？焦虑不会消失，只会转移</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="541">09:01</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="693">11:33</a> 到了大学，我的配得感越来越低了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a>每个人的生活方式都会给我一些灵感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a> 一起逃离单一价值体系！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a>也许比别人做得慢，那又怎样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1205">20:05</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>缓解焦虑，请你认清自己先！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 焦虑，其实是被建构出来的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>香香</span></p><span></span><p><span>米饼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【求关注】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书「随便你」</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多平台敬请期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听「随便你」，我们下期再来随便聊！</span></p>]]></description>
