    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/664f243b4efbc0c3dc92af28</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">664f243b4efbc0c3dc92af28</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2024 11:10:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>还在读中学的我，陷入了甜蜜的恋爱中！</span></p><span></span><p><span>课上发呆，恍惚间想着，</span></p><span></span><p><span>只在小说和电影中看到的浪漫剧情，也会发生在我的身上吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>精心编织一套缜密的故事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>瞒过父母老师的火眼金睛，</span></p><span></span><p><span>只是为了，和喜欢的ta多呆一会儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>......</span></p><span></span><p><span>“早恋”这个概念从何而来？我们又应该如何对待校园时期这种朦胧的情感？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你对“早恋”有自己的体会，请加入「随便你」聊天室</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>与我们畅聊你的“早恋”故事和对“早恋”的看法！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>快来听三分钟「随便你」，不管怎么做都支持你！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">0:55</a></span></strong><span> “早恋”的一种定义</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">1:56</a></span></strong><span> 米的“早恋”经历</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="479">7:59</a></span></strong><span> 《家有儿女》中关于“早恋”的经典语录</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a></span></strong><span> 雷老师“早恋”被抓的经历</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a></span></strong><span> 香香和父母在恋爱话题上的沟通摩擦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1247">20:47</a></span></strong><span> “你谈恋爱开心吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a></span></strong><span> 早恋的情感VS成熟的情感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a></span></strong><span> 对于伴侣“早恋”对象“前人栽树”的精神洁癖？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a></span></strong><span> 文艺作品形塑的的青春期恋爱幻想</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a></span></strong><span> 百度上已经没有“早恋”这个词条了！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>香香</span></p><span></span><p><span>雷老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>米饼</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【求关注】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书「随便你」</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多平台敬请期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听「随便你」，我们下期再来随便聊！</span></p>]]></description>
