    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你的周末有些松弛，但你的旅游计划又弥补了这一部分！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎来到闲聊对谈类播客《随便你》</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道你是否有这样的经历：</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅行拍了好多照片，却屯在相机里一张都没有发</span></p><span></span><p><span>做了一份详细的旅行计划，但最后完全没有落地</span></p><span></span><p><span>带了一堆乱七八糟的东西旅行，但它们在包里的位置完全没有动过</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>五一假期来到，不如加入「随便你」聊天室</span></p><span></span><p><span>与我们畅谈旅行中的吃住行，进行旅游观的大讨论！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间线】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 堆了好多旅游照片！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 出游选择什么交通方式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 出游的住宿怎么选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a>“吃”在旅游中重要吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2572">42:52</a> 旅行中不经意的“意外”和“惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3182">53:02</a> 自然景观VS城市景观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3624">1:00:24</a> 你的“出游观”受到了什么影响？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3994">1:06:34</a>“完全有空”的周末是伪命题！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4249">1:10:49</a> 出游的时候会带……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4502">1:15:02</a> 平时跟谁出去玩？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4662">1:17:42</a> 调休其实也有它的好处！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4911">1:21:51</a> 保证周末旅游质量的tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5163">1:26:03</a> 总结环节~~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>香香</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sasa</span></p><span></span><p><span>雷老师</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【求关注】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书「随便你」</span></p><span></span><p><span>同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多平台敬请期待</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>感谢收听「随便你」，我们下期再来随便聊！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
